1)Difference between label encoder and ordinal encoder and one hot encoder

Label Encoder:Converts categories into numbers (e.g., "Apple" → 0, "Banana" → 1) & For target labels or non-ordered features

Ordinal Encoder:Converts categories into numbers with order (e.g., "Low" → 1, "Medium" → 2, "High" → 3) & For ordered categories

one hot:Creates binary columns for each categories &For non-ordered features with few unique values



